        },
        {
          "text": "Lino bulemu bwa-Leza wa-Israyeli bwakalitantide kuzwa kukerebimu mpaakakede kuya kucikunguzyo caŋanda. Mpawo wakoongolola oyo muntu iwakasamide masani aatuba, iwakajisi zilembyo mucikungu cakwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
