              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jos 7:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino nibakali mukuuma, mebo ndakasyaala endike, nkabela ndakavundama ansi, ndakati, Akaka Mwami Jehova! Sa ulayanda kunyonyoona boonse ba-Israyeli basyeede mbotilila Jerusalemu bukali bwako? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
